                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I enjoyed A Golden Wake very much, and I don't think this game deserves all the bad reviews it has received.\n\nAlthough I'm not particularly interested in American real estate history, I found the game quite entertaining, charming, and funny. I enjoyed the first two chapters more than the last one, but overall, it was still a very enjoyable experience. The puzzles weren't too difficult to solve, either.\n\nI'd recommend buying it on sale if you're unsure.",
